<title>JAPAN: Japan Paper, Jujo Paper sign agreement to merge.</title>
<headline>Japan Paper, Jujo Paper sign agreement to merge.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Paper Industry Co Ltd and Jujo Paper Board Co Ltd said on Wednesday they had formally agreed to merge and that the new company would be named Japan Paperboard Industries Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The merger will take place on October 1.</p>
<p>Both firms are members of the Nippon Paper Industries Co Ltd group.</p>
</text>
